<title>USA: Liz Claiborne optimistic for rest of 1997.</title>
<headline>Liz Claiborne optimistic for rest of 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liz Claiborne Inc said Monday said it expected healthy wholesale orders to continue driving sales and earnings higher during the remainder of 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Based upon trends in wholesale bookings, we are optimistic about our ability to continue to report improvement in sales and earnings for the remainder of 1997,&quot; said Samuel Miller, chief financial officer of the company.</p>
</text>
